  "job_B3.3.25_20251003_114713": {
    "text": "TO SANCTAE MICHAHELES M\u00c6SSAN.\nMEN \u00f0a leofestan, mana\u00fe us & mynga\u00fe seo ar \u00e6 seo eadignes \u00fe\u00e6s hean & \u00fe\u00e6s halgan heahengles tid,\n& \u00feus \u00e6rest mannum \u00e6teawde & gecy\u00fede.\nHeo \u00feonne nalles on goldes wlite & on seolfres ne scine\u00fe, ac on sundorweor\u00feunge \u00feurh godcundra\nHeo is eac on onsyne utan yfeles heowes, ac heo is innan mid ece m\u00e6gene geweor\u00feod.\nSwa hit ea\u00fee beon m\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6t se halga heahengel of heofenum cumen w\u00e6re, & w\u00e6re gemyndig manna\n\u00deonne is seo halige cirice Michaeles geseted on \u00fe\u00e6m hean cnolle sumes muntes, on scr\u00e6fes onlicnesse\n\u00d0onne is \u00fe\u00e6r on neaweste sum swi\u00fee m\u00e6re burh betwih \u00fe\u00e6re s\u00e6 seo is nemned Adriaticus on \u00fe\u00e6m\n\u00deonne syndon from \u00fe\u00e6re burge weallum twelf mila ametene up to \u00fe\u00e6m hean cnolle, \u00fee ic \u00e6r big s\u00e6gde,\n\u00d0as circean heo \u00feonne \u00feus \u00e6teowde & gecy\u00fede \u00e6t fruman seo ilce boc seo on \u00fe\u00e6re ciricean funden\nSege\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6ron \u00fe\u00e6t sum rice man & for worlde \u00e6htspedig w\u00e6re on \u00fe\u00e6re burh \u00fe\u00e6s nama w\u00e6s Garganus.\nSe welega man \u00fe\u00e6m munte gesette \u00feone ilcan naman swa swa he hatte.\nSe man ahte mycelne welan; mid \u00fey \u00fee \u00feas welegan mannes ungeendod weorod & unarimed mengeo\n\u00dea gelamp \u00fe\u00e6t sum fearhry\u00feer \u00fe\u00e6s o\u00fer\u00e6s ceapes geferscipe oferhogode, & him gewunode \u00fe\u00e6t he w\u00e6s\nHe \u00fea se fear \u00fe\u00e6s hyrdes drafe forhogode & him on \u00fe\u00e6t westen gewunode to sumes scr\u00e6fes dura.\n\u00d0a \u00fe\u00e6t se hlaford geahsode \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t hry\u00feer swa on wlencu geond \u00fe\u00e6t westen ferde, \u00fea forbealh he hine\n\u00dea gesamnode he mycel weorod his manna & hwearf \u00e6fter wegum ge buton geond \u00feone wudu, &\n\u00d0a gemette he hit \u00e6t nehsstan on \u00fe\u00e6s muntes cnolle, & geseah \u00fe\u00e6t hit stod an sumes scr\u00e6fes dura.\n\u00dea w\u00e6s he mid yrre swi\u00f0lice onstyred, for\u00f0on \u00fee hit swa wedende eode, & swa ofermodlice ferde.\n\u00dea genam he his bogan & hine gebende, & \u00f0a mid ge\u00e6ttredum str\u00e6le ongan sceotan wi\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee he\n\u00d0a sona mid \u00fean \u00fee se str\u00e6l on flyge w\u00e6s, \u00fea com swi\u00f0e mycel windes bl\u00e6d foran ongean, \u00fe\u00e6t seo\n\u00d0a \u00fe\u00e6t gesawon \u00f0a burgware, \u00f0a wurdon hie swi\u00f0e forhte for \u00f0\u00e6m f\u00e6re \u00fee heo n\u00e6fre swylc wundor ne\nOnd \u00fea ne dorstan hie \u00fe\u00e6re stowe geneal\u00e6can \u00fee hie \u00fe\u00e6t hry\u00feer gesawon \u00e6t stondan.\n\u00d0a w\u00e6s on \u00fea ilcan tid on \u00fe\u00e6re heora byrig se w\u00e6s haten Sepontus halig biscep.\n\u00dea gesohtan hie hine & him \u00fe\u00e6t wundor s\u00e6gdon, & hie hine lare beahsodan, hw\u00e6t him \u00fe\u00e6s to donne\n\u00dea l\u00e6rde he hie & him to r\u00e6de fand \u00fe\u00e6t hie \u00fery dagas f\u00e6ston, & to Sancte Michaele \u00fe\u00e6t hie wilnodan\n\u00dea hie \u00fe\u00e6t gedon h\u00e6fdon ge on f\u00e6stenne, ge on sealmsange, ge on \u00e6lmessan, \u00f0a w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6m ilcan\n& him \u00fea ea\u00f0modlice & luflice tospr\u00e6c & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00f0, Weoroldlice & wislice ge dyde \u00fe\u00e6tte mannum\nWite \u00feu eac \u00fe\u00e6t se mon se \u00fe\u00e6r mid his agenum str\u00e6le ofsceoten w\u00e6s, \u00fea \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s mid minum willan\nSecgge ic \u00fee nu eac \u00fe\u00e6t ic onsundrum \u00fea stowe her on eor\u00f0an lufige, & ofer ealle o\u00fere ic hie geceas &\n\u00dea \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s \u00feus gesprecen & gecy\u00f0ed, hie \u00fea \u00fea burgware swi\u00fee bli\u00fee & gefeonde mid \u00feon heora\n& \u00fea \u00e6fter heora gewunon \u00fe\u00e6r \u00feone lifgendan God & \u00feone halgan heahengel Michael meagollice\n& hie \u00fea \u00f0\u00e6r twa dura sceawodan on \u00fe\u00e6re ciricean; \u00f0\u00e6r w\u00e6s seo su\u00f0duru hw\u00e6t hwega hade mare.\n& \u00fea gyt hi ne mihton ofer \u00fe\u00e6t scr\u00e6f swa sw\u00e6\u00f0hlype \u00fe\u00e6r hi gongan, \u00e6r\u00f0on hie gerymdon \u00feone upgang\nAc hie daga gehwylce geornlice \u00fe\u00e6r ute heora gebedum \u00e6t fulgon.\nOn \u00fea ilcan tid Neapolite \u00f0a heora nehgeburas \u00fea \u00fee \u00fea giet on h\u00e6\u00f0enum \u00feeawum dwelgende w\u00e6ron,\nHie \u00fea \u00fea burgware Beneuentius & Sepontanus hatton, \u00fea twa leode, hie \u00fea ongunnon anwigges biddan\nHie \u00fea l\u00e6rde se heora halga bisceop, & him to r\u00e6de fand \u00fe\u00e6t hie dydon \u00fereora daga f\u00e6sten &\n\u00dea on \u00fea ilcan tid \u00fea h\u00e6\u00f0nan bysmerlice & synlice heora \u00fea leasan godas mid mislicum deofolgeldum\n\u00dea on \u00f0a ilcan tid w\u00e6s se eadiga engel Michahel \u00e6tiewed \u00fe\u00e6m hera bisceope on gesih\u00fee, & him sige\n& him eac geheht, \u00fe\u00e6t he wolde him sylfa geseon heora geb\u00e6ro, & him \u00fe\u00e6r on fultume beon.\nHie \u00fea swa bli\u00fee on morgenne w\u00e6ron, & gefeonde ferdon ongean \u00fe\u00e6m he\u00f0num.\n& hie wiston be \u00fe\u00e6s engles s\u00e6genum, ge be heora sige, ge eac be \u00feara h\u00e6\u00feenra manna fleame &\n& \u00fea sona on \u00f0\u00e6re frym\u00fee \u00fe\u00e6s gefeohtes, \u00f0a w\u00e6s Garganus se munt, se \u00fee hie onfeohtan sceoldan,\n\u00d0a flugon \u00fea legetu swylce fyrene str\u00e6las ongean \u00fea h\u00e6\u00f0nan leode, to\u00f0\u00e6m \u00feicce \u00fe\u00e6t hie n\u00e6nige\n\u00dea w\u00e6s gefylled \u00fe\u00e6t se witga fores\u00e6gde; & Drihten herede & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00f0: Qui facit angelos suos\n\u00d0a flugon \u00fea h\u00e6\u00f0nan leode, & gelice se leg hie cwylmde, gelice \u00fea Cristenan him mid heora w\u00e6pnum\n\u00dea us \u00fea w\u00e6s gecy\u00feed Cristenum leodum, se Godes engel \u00fe\u00e6r cwom on fultum & on frofre.\n& \u00fea sona ealle ea\u00f0modlice to \u00fe\u00e6m cyninga Cyninge, to Criste sylfum, onhnigan.\n& him ealle on hand eodan \u00fea h\u00e6\u00f0nan leode, & be \u00feara Cristenra lare lifdon & fulwihte onfengon.\n& hie ongeaton geornlice \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6m Cristenum leodum com Godes engel on fultum & on frofre.\n& \u00fea mid \u00fey \u00fee \u00fea Cristenan leode \u00fe\u00e6t wel sceawodan, \u00f0a gesawon hie & getealdon \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6r w\u00e6s eac\nHie \u00fea swa sigebeorhte & swa gebegde mid mycelre blisse to ham foran, & sona \u00fe\u00e6m \u00e6lmihtigan\n\u00dea gemittan hie eac beforan \u00f0\u00e6re nor\u00f0dura \u00fe\u00e6re ciricean on \u00fe\u00e6m marmanstane swylce mannes\n& \u00fea fotlastas w\u00e6ron swutole & gesyne on \u00fe\u00e6m stane, swa hie on wexe w\u00e6ron a\u00f0yde.\n\u00dea ongeaton hie geornlice \u00fe\u00e6t se eadiga Michael \u00fe\u00e6r w\u00e6s toweard him to fultome, \u00f0a hwile \u00f0e hie \u00e6t\n& him sylfa \u00fe\u00e6t tacn \u00fe\u00e6s siges gesette, & gecy\u00f0de into \u00fey swi\u00f0an sl\u00e6pe.\nOn \u00f0\u00e6m stane hi \u00fea sona \u00f0\u00e6r ciricean ofergetimbredon & \u00fe\u00e6r weofod inne wlitelice geworhtan &\n& \u00fea stowe mid mycclum gefean seo\u00fe\u00fean weor\u00feodan & beeodan, hie \u00fea h\u00e6fdan miccle lufan &\nOnd eac healico ondrysnu \u00fea leode.\n& him w\u00e6s on mode myccle weorce & mycel tweo hw\u00e6t hie be \u00fe\u00e6re dorstan don, hwe\u00feer hie \u00fea\nHie \u00fea \u00fe\u00e6t to r\u00e6de \u00e6rest fundon, \u00fe\u00e6t hie ciricean ar\u00e6rdon be eastan \u00fe\u00e6re stowe, & \u00fea gehalgodan on\n& \u00fe\u00e6r gedydon twa weofedu in, & gehalgodan on Sanct\u00e6 Marian noman Cristes modor, & o\u00f0er on\nHim \u00fea se heora arwyr\u00f0a bisceop eadiglice & halwendlice ge\u00f0eaht for\u00f0brohte, & hie l\u00e6rede \u00fe\u00e6t hie\n\u00deislic \u00e6rende se eadiga papa \u00f0a \u00f0\u00e6r eft onsende & \u00feas word cw\u00e6\u00f0, Gif hit sie mannes gemet \u00fe\u00e6t he\nGif hit \u00feonne hw\u00e6t elles \u00f0\u00e6m halgan hirede be \u00fe\u00e6re stowe licige, & him leofre sie, \u00feonne is hit ealles\nOnd \u00feonne seo tid neal\u00e6ce uton wit \u00feonne begen don mid uncrum burhwarum feower daga f\u00e6sten, &\nHie \u00f0a ealle ea\u00f0modlice, swa heora \u00e6\u00feela bisceo\u00fe l\u00e6rde, feower daga f\u00e6sten gedydon.\n\u00dea \u00f0\u00e6re nihte \u00fee hie \u00fe\u00e6t f\u00e6sten gef\u00e6st h\u00e6fdon, \u00fea w\u00e6s Sanctus Michael \u00fe\u00e6m bisceope on gesih\u00fee\nGe \u00feonne nu \u00feyder ingonga\u00f0 & me \u00e6tstonda\u00f0, & geornlice mundbyrde gelyfa\u00f0 to \u00f0\u00e6re stowe, & hie\n\u00d0in is \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu \u00fe\u00e6r to morgne m\u00e6ssan inne gesinge, & \u00feis folc \u00fe\u00e6r after \u00f0eawe to husle gange.\nMin is \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6t ic mid arwyr\u00f0nesse tacne \u00e6teowe & gecy\u00fee hine, \u00feurh hine sylfne hie gehalgode &\nHie \u00f0a sona on morgenne swi\u00f0e gefeonde for \u00f0\u00e6re andsware mid mycelre anr\u00e6dnesse gebeda & mid\nOf \u00f0\u00e6s portices dura \u00fe\u00e6s \u00f0\u00e6rscwolde w\u00e6s gesyne \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea swa\u00f0o w\u00e6ron \u00e6rest utwearde ongunnen, \u00f0e\n\u00deeos circe mid \u00feys portice mihte hu hwego fif hund manna befon & behabban.\n\u00d0onne w\u00e6s \u00e6teowed \u00fe\u00e6t arwyr\u00f0e weofod wi\u00f0 \u00feone su\u00f0wag to middes hu hwega \u00f0\u00e6s wages.\nW\u00e6s hit eac bewrigen & oferbr\u00e6ded mid baswe godwebbe.\nW\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t ilce hus eac hwem dragen, nalas \u00e6fter gewunan mennisces weorces \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea wagas w\u00e6ron\n& gelomlice \u00f0a stanas swa of o\u00f0rum clife st\u00e6\u00f0hylplice ut sceoredon.\nEac swylce se hrof w\u00e6s on mislicre heanesse; on sumre stowe he w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t man mid his handa nealice\nIc \u00feonne gelyfe \u00fe\u00e6t se heahengel ures Drihtnes miccle swi\u00f0or sohte & lufode \u00fe\u00e6re heortan cl\u00e6nnesse\n\u00d0onne w\u00e6s se cnoll swa hit nu cu\u00f0 is, \u00fe\u00e6t se munt is mycel uteweard; & he is styccem\u00e6lum mid\nOnd \u00fea \u00e6fter \u00feon \u00fee \u00f0\u00e6r w\u00e6ron \u00f0a halgan lofsangas & m\u00e6ssan gefyllede, hie \u00f0a mid mycclum gefean\nSe bisceop \u00fea \u00f0\u00e6r gesette gode sangeras & m\u00e6ssepreostas & manigfealdlice ciricean \u00feegnas, \u00fea \u00fe\u00e6r\nN\u00e6s hwe\u00f0re n\u00e6nig man \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r \u00e6fre nihtes tidum dorste on \u00fe\u00e6re ciricean cuman.\nAc on d\u00e6gred si\u00fe\u00fean hit frumlyhte, hie \u00feyder inw\u00e6ron to \u00f0\u00e6m lofsangum gesamnode.\n\u00deonne w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6r eac of \u00fe\u00e6m ilcan stane \u00fe\u00e6re ciricean hrofes on \u00fea nor\u00f0healfe \u00fe\u00e6s weofodes swi\u00fee\n\u00deonne w\u00e6s ongean \u00f0yssum w\u00e6terscipe gl\u00e6sen f\u00e6t on seolfrenre racenteage ahangen \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0\u00e6s\n\u00de\u00e6r w\u00e6s gewuna \u00fe\u00e6m folce \u00feonne hie to husle gegangen h\u00e6fdon, \u00fe\u00e6t hie \u00e6fter hl\u00e6ddrum up to \u00f0\u00e6m\nSeo \u00feonne w\u00e6s wynsumu on \u00f0\u00e6re onbyrignesse, & heo w\u00e6s on \u00fe\u00e6m inno\u00f0e halwende.\nIs \u00feis eac to tacne \u00fe\u00e6t manige men on feforadle & on mislicum o\u00ferum untrumnessum \u00feurh \u00feyses\nEac swylce o\u00ferum gemetum unarimede manna untrumnessa \u00f0\u00e6r w\u00e6ron oft & gelome geh\u00e6lde.\n& manigfeald onlic wundor \u00f0ysum, \u00f0am \u00fee heora miht w\u00e6s gelimplic & arwyr\u00f0e, \u00f0\u00e6r w\u00e6ron & gyt\n\u00d0onne of \u00f0\u00e6m \u00feeodlande \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r ymbsyndon \u00f0a folc \u00fe\u00e6r cumende beo\u00f0, \u00feonne is to gelyfenne\n& \u00f0\u00e6s engles m\u00e6gen & his wundor \u00fe\u00e6r \u00feonne weor\u00f0od bi\u00f0, & oftost \u00e6teowed on \u00fe\u00e6m d\u00e6ge.\nSwa cw\u00e6\u00f0 Sanctus Paulus, Qui ad ministrum summis; Englas beo\u00f0 to \u00f0egnunge g\u00e6stum fram Gode\nAc uton nu biddan \u00feone heahengel Sanctus Michahel & \u00f0a nigen endebyrdnessa \u00f0ara haligra engla,\nHie w\u00e6ron \u00fea halgan on onfenge manna saulum.\nSwa Sanctus Paulus w\u00e6s geseonde on nor\u00f0anweardne \u00feisne middangeard, \u00fe\u00e6r ealle w\u00e6tero\n& w\u00e6ron nor\u00f0 of \u00f0\u00e6m stane awexene swi\u00f0e hrimige bearwas, & \u00f0\u00e6r w\u00e6ron \u00feystrogenipo, & under\n& he geseah \u00fe\u00e6t on \u00f0\u00e6m clife hangodan on \u00f0\u00e6m isigean bearwum manige swearte saula be heora\n& \u00fea fynd \u00feara on nicra onlicnesse heora gripende w\u00e6ron, swa swa gr\u00e6dig wulf.\n& \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6ter w\u00e6s sweart under \u00fe\u00e6m clife neo\u00f0an.\n& betuh \u00fe\u00e6m clife on \u00f0\u00e6m w\u00e6tre w\u00e6ron swylce twelf mila.\n& \u00f0onne \u00f0a twigo forburston \u00feonne gewitan \u00fea saula ni\u00f0er \u00fea \u00fee on \u00f0\u00e6m twigum hangodan, & him\n\u00d0is \u00f0onne w\u00e6ron \u00f0a saula \u00fea \u00f0e her on worlde mid unrihte gefyrenode w\u00e6ron, & \u00f0\u00e6s noldan\nAc uton nu biddan Sanctus Michael geornlice \u00fe\u00e6t he ure saula gel\u00e6de on gefean, \u00fe\u00e6r hie motan\nAMEN.",
